Third-party dependency attribution

Calendar conversion for the calendars that are not a renumbered Gregorian
year — Islamic Hijri (Umm al-Qura) and Solar Hijri / Jalali — is performed
by the `calendrical_calculations` crate, which implements algorithms from
*Calendrical Calculations* by Reingold & Dershowitz and is maintained by
the Unicode Consortium as part of the ICU4X project.

